WEBVTT

00:01:31.893 --> 00:01:35.774
Stranded in the open,

00:01:37.314 --> 00:01:39.475
dried out tears of

00:01:39.655 --> 00:01:44.696
sorrow, lacking all

00:01:44.776 --> 00:01:45.696
emotion.

00:01:47.937 --> 00:01:51.378
Staring down the barrel,

00:01:51.658 --> 00:01:54.519
waiting for the final

00:01:54.659 --> 00:02:00.360
gates to open to a new

00:02:00.641 --> 00:02:02.441
tomorrow.

00:02:04.022 --> 00:02:07.683
Moving with the motion,

00:02:09.283 --> 00:02:21.727
following the light that

00:02:22.027 --> 00:02:24.948
sets me free.